 prices for American consumers, forcing them to cut spending and weakening demand for Bangladeshi garments.","u":"https://www.thedailystar.net/business/global-economy/news/us-tariff-clouds-bangladesh-garment-outlook-4334176","s":"dailystar-biz","sn":"The Daily Star (Business)","c":"business","p":"2026-11-26T18:00:00.000Z","l":"en"},{"id":"056153fc9441","t":"Soybean oil price up Tk 3 a litre","d":"The government yesterday allowed local refiners to raise the price of soybean oil by Tk 3 a litre, citing higher international prices and import costs, while palm oil rates remain unchanged.","u":"https://www.thedailystar.net/business/economy/news/soybean-oil-price-tk-3-litre-4334171","s":"dailystar-biz","sn":"The Daily Star (Business)","c":"business","p":"2026-11-26T18:00:00.000Z","l":"en"},{"id":"e38afd321399","t":"Gold imports thru Dhaka customs plunge over 99% in 3 years","d":"Gold imports through Customs House Dhaka fell by more than 99 percent in three years, with industry insiders and officials blaming hiked duties, tightened baggage rules and lengthy procedures.","u":"https://www.thedailystar.net/business/economy/news/gold-imports-thru-dhaka-customs-plunge-over-99-3-years-4334166","s":"dailystar-biz","sn":"The Daily Star (Business)","c":"business","p":"2026-11-26T18:00:00.000Z","l":"en"},{"id":"6840fd3cfe53","t":"Govt to fast-track projects worth over Tk 50cr in four sectors","d":"The government has formed a five-member inter-ministerial committee to simplify feasibility assessment requirements and remove other procedural hurdles for development projects worth more than Tk 50 crore in the social protection, women and child development, education and health sectors.","u":"https://www.thedailystar.net/business/economy/news/govt-fast-track-projects-worth-over-tk-50cr-four-sectors-4334161","s":"dailystar-biz","sn":"The Daily Star (Business)","c":"business","p":"2026-11-26T18:00:00.000Z","l":"en"},{"id":"da9e7b6de27e","t":"BB caps cash foreign currency selling rate","d":"Bangladesh Bank has directed banks to ensure that the maximum exchange rate for selling cash foreign currency does not exceed the BC (Bills for Collection) selling rate, in a move aimed at stabilising the cash forex market and protecting customers.","u":"https://www.thedailystar.net/business/economy/news/bb-caps-cash-foreign-currency-selling-rate-4334156","s":"dailystar-biz","sn":"The Daily Star (Business)","c":"business","p":"2026-11-26T18:00:00.000Z","l":"en"},{"id":"7125ca9a9945","t":"Govt to import 4.4 lakh tonnes of US wheat","d":"The government on Wednesday night approved the tariff structures for electricity purchases from two coal-fired power plants and a proposal to import 4.40 lakh tonnes of wheat from the United States.","u":"https://www.thedailystar.net/business/economy/news/govt-import-44-lakh-tonnes-us-wheat-4334151","s":"dailystar-biz","sn":"The Daily Star (Business)","c":"business","p":"2026-11-26T18:00:00.000Z","l":"en"},{"id":"4f39688352d5","t":"27,000 online businesses identified for VAT scrutiny","d":"The National Board of Revenue (NBR) has identified around 27,000 e-commerce businesses, most without a business identification number (BIN), for potential VAT scrutiny as part of efforts to bring online businesses into the formal tax system.","u":"https://www.thedailystar.net/business/economy/news/27000-online-businesses-identified-vat-scrutiny-4334146","s":"dailystar-biz","sn":"The Daily Star (Business)","c":"business","p":"2026-11-26T18:00:00.000Z","l":"en"},{"id":"2e66d76336b6","t":"A showcase of creativity and entrepreneurial zeal","d":"At one corner of the 13th National SME Product Fair, Mohammad Abdur Rahim sat weaving a turquoise Jamdani saree as curious visitors gathered around his handloom.","u":"https://www.thedailystar.net/business/economy/news/showcase-creativity-and-entrepreneurial-zeal-4334141","s":"dailystar-biz","sn":"The Daily Star (Business)","c":"business","p":"2026-11-26T18:00:00.000Z","l":"en"},{"id":"582ae8f7828c","t":"Trump’s new tariffs aim to prise global trade from China’s grip","d":"The United States’ latest tariff hikes are set to inflame trade tension with Beijing, making it the key target of Washington’s bid to reorder global trade by punishing the factory of the world through pressure on other countries.","u":"https://www.thedailystar.net/business/global-economy/news/trumps-new-tariffs-aim-prise-global-trade-chinas-grip-4334131","s":"dailystar-biz","sn":"The Daily Star (Business)","c":"business","p":"2026-11-26T18:00:00.000Z","l":"en"},{"id":"4373a6779dc0","t":"A candle mistaken for ice cream","d":"Would you rather be an ice cream or a candle? Ask anyone in Dhaka on a sticky Chaitra afternoon, and the vote goes to ice cream. Ask at night, when load-shedding strikes, and everyone is hunting for a candle. An ice cream enjoys life until it melts. A candle lights up other lives until it melts. By morning, both are gone, but only one is missed. Watching the unrest in our garment sector, I…","u":"https://www.thedailystar.net/business/economy/news/candle-mistaken-ice-cream-4334121","s":"dailystar-biz","sn":"The Daily Star (Business)","c":"business","p":"2026-11-26T18:00:00.000Z","l":"en"},{"id":"10c51232a815","t":"PM’s policy is ‘Bangladesh first’, for others it is self-interest first","d":"We have never been short of slogans, but have always failed to realise them. Even when we achieved some success, the benefits never reached the people.","u":"https://www.thedailystar.net/opinion/views/the-third-view/news/pms-policy-bangladesh-first-others-it-self-interest-first-4334281","s":"dailystar-opinion","sn":"The Daily Star (Opinion)","c":"editorial","p":"2026-11-26T18:00:00.000Z","l":"en"},{"id":"21d7c6584bbc","t":"Bangladesh tops South Asia in child marriage, with nearly half of young women wed before 18","d":"","u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","s":"dhakatribune","sn":"Dhaka Tribune","c":"national","p":"2026-11-26T18:00:00.000Z","l":"en"},{"id":"9067a5e3e283","t":"Myanmar won’t comply with ICJ genocide orders","d":"Myanmar’s military-backed president has said his administration will not comply with all measures ordered by the UN’s top court, which last week ruled that the country’s security forces had committed genocide against Rohingyas.","u":"https://www.thedailystar.net/rohingya-influx/news/myanmar-wont-comply-icj-genocide-orders-4334316","s":"dailystar-world","sn":"The Daily Star (World)","c":"international","p":"2026-11-26T18:00:00.000Z","l":"en"},{"id":"98a16ac05eee","t":"Israeli strikes, gunfire kill 9 in Gaza Strip","d":"Israeli airstrikes and gunfire killed at least nine Palestinians in Gaza overnight, medics said, including the Hamas-appointed deputy minister of education, in a third consecutive night of air attacks despite a one-year-old ceasefire.","u":"https://www.thedailystar.net/news/world/news/israeli-strikes-gunfire-kill-9-gaza-strip-4334261","s":"dailystar-world","sn":"The Daily Star (World)","c":"international","p":"2026-11-26T18:00:00.000Z","l":"en"},{"id":"b8d2bae2013a","t":"KSA downs missiles targeting Riyadh","d":"Explosions echoed above Riyadh as Saudi armed forces yesterday reported downing missiles and drones launched by Yemen’s Houthis, just a day after the Iran-backed group claimed strikes on the capital.","u":"https://www.thedailystar.net/news/world/news/ksa-downs-missiles-targeting-riyadh-4334271","s":"dailystar-world","sn":"The Daily Star (World)","c":"international","p":"2026-11-26T18:00:00.000Z","l":"en"},{"id":"d02bfee4a0ba","t":"Russia accuses Ukraine of trying to widen conflict zone","d":"The Kremlin yesterday accused Ukraine of trying to spread the war it is fighting against Russia to the Mediterranean and Baltics seas, a move it called very dangerous.","u":"https://www.thedailystar.net/news/world/news/russia-accuses-ukraine-trying-widen-conflict-zone-4334256","s":"dailystar-world","sn":"The Daily Star (World)","c":"international","p":"2026-11-26T18:00:00.000Z","l":"en"},{"id":"a202c716b34c","t":"India’s Congress party sues Meta, federal govt","d":"India’s main opposition Congress party has sued Meta and federal government, saying an automated content-removal system is blocking political posts and images of opposition leader Rahul Gandhi ahead of state polls.","u":"https://www.thedailystar.net/news/world/news/indias-congress-party-sues-meta-federal-govt-4334251","s":"dailystar-world","sn":"The Daily Star (World)","c":"international","p":"2026-11-26T18:00:00.000Z","l":"en"}]}